<p>表4-2　改版后的注册漏斗</p>
<figure>
<img src="/book/growth-data-analytics-playbook/images/fig-04-05.webp" alt="图4-5　改版后的注册漏斗：走到欢迎页的人从19个变成58个" width="1400" height="707" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
