· <!-- -->EN</p></div><span class="h-2.5 w-2.5 shrink-0 rounded-full" style="background-color:#FF6B78;box-shadow:0 0 20px #FF6B78"></span></div><div class="mt-auto max-w-[88%]"><h3 class="font-sans font-semibold text-white [text-wrap:balance] text-xl sm:text-2xl">Augmenting Data Science in the AI Era</h3><p class="mt-3 font-mono text-[9px] uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-white/45">Data &amp; decisions</p></div></div></div></a><div class="flex flex-1 flex-col px-2 pb-2 pt-5"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.13em]"><span style="color:#FF6B78">Data &amp; decisions</span><span class="text-white/20">/</span><span class="text-white/45">Enterprise</span><span class="text-white/20">/</span><span class="text-white/45">English</span></div><p class="mt-4 text-[15px] leading-7 text-zinc-300">AI should expand the questions a data scientist can answer—not merely shorten the time to the next query.</p><p class="mt-4 text-xs leading-5 text-zinc-500">Data scientists<!-- --> · Data Science team session</p><div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4 pt-6"><a href="https://www.superlinear.academy/c/public/sections/900177/lessons/3409683" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm font-semibold text-white transition hover:text-white">Watch replay<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-play h-3.5 w-3.5"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><polygon points="10 8 16 12 10 16 10 8"></polygon></svg></a></div></div></article></div></section><section id="strategy-knowledge"><div class="grid gap-4 border-t border-white/10 pt-6 md:grid-cols-[0.72fr_1.28fr] md:items-start"><div class="flex items-center gap-3"><span class="font-mono text-[10px] text-zinc-600">02</span><h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white md:text-2xl">Strategy &amp; knowledge work</h3></div><p class="max-w-2xl text-sm leading-7 text-zinc-500">Turn judgment, context, and repeated research into systems that compound.</p></div><div class="mt-7 grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-2 xl:grid-cols-3"><article class="group flex h-full flex-col rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.035] p-3 transition duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-white/20 hover:bg-white/[0.055]"><a href="/decks/end-of-fake-work" class="block"><div class="group/cover relative aspect-[16/10] overflow-hidden rounded-xl border" style="--deck-accent:#EE4B2B;border-color:#EE4B2B55;background:linear-gradient(145deg, #EE4B2B24 0%, rgba(10,14,24,0.98) 62%)"><div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-25" style="background-image:linear-gradient(rgba(255,255,255,.09) 1px, transparent 1px), linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255,255,255,.09) 1px, transparent 1px);background-size:28px 28px;mask-image:linear-gradient(to bottom left, black, transparent 74%)"></div><div class="absolute -right-[12%] -top-[20%] h-[72%] w-[52%] rounded-full border opacity-35 transition duration-500 group-hover/cover:scale-110" style="border-color:#EE4B2B;box-shadow:0 0 80px #EE4B2B22"></div><div class="absolute bottom-0 right-0 h-[36%] w-[52%] -skew-x-12 opacity-15" style="background-color:#EE4B2B"></div><div class="relative flex h-full flex-col p-5 sm:p-6"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4"><div><p class="font-mono text-[9px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em]" style="color:#EE4B2B">刘润直播间</p><p class="mt-1 font-mono text-[9px] uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-white/45">2026-10<!-- --> · <!-- -->ZH</p></div><span class="h-2.5 w-2.5 shrink-0 rounded-full" style="background-color:#EE4B2B;box-shadow:0 0 20px #EE4B2B"></span></div><div class="mt-auto max-w-[88%]"><h3 class="font-sans font-semibold text-white [text-wrap:balance] text-xl sm:text-2xl">假工作的终结</h3><p class="mt-3 font-mono text-[9px] uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-white/45">Strategy &amp; knowledge work</p></div></div></div></a><div class="flex flex-1 flex-col px-2 pb-2 pt-5"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.13em]"><span style="color:#EE4B2B">Strategy &amp; knowledge work</span><span class="text-white/20">/</span><span class="text-white/45">Public session</span><span class="text-white/20">/</span><span class="text-white/45">Chinese</span></div><p class="mt-4 text-[15px] leading-7 text-zinc-300">Fake work swaps value that is hard to measure for actions that are easy to see. AI makes looking busy nearly free, so fake work will first explode and then lose its price. We could never tell real from fake because the visible layer of reports, plans and decks was costly to produce and served as a proxy for the skill below the waterline. That proxy has now failed, so we have to look directly at judgment and at what it grows from: a world model shaped by the scientific method, and craft shaped by practice. What most people lack is the ability, the habits and the mechanisms to see it.</p><p class="mt-4 text-xs leading-5 text-zinc-500">Professionals and managers who stay busy all week but can&#x27;t say what their work changed, and anyone asking what still counts once AI can write the reports<!-- --> · Liu Run&#x27;s livestream · talk on the book 《真本事》</p><div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4 pt-6"><a href="/decks/end-of-fake-work" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm font-semibold text-white transition hover:text-white">Read online<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right h-3.5 w-3.5"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a><a href="https://www.lizheng.ai/decks/end-of-fake-work/slides" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm font-medium text-zin